# <name>.spool

A shared Millstrand spool.

## Prerequisites

Approve this spool and each prerequisite explicitly in the operator workspace.

## Dependency information

Pin this repository and its prerequisites in `.millstrand/spools.edn` or `.ms/spools.edn`; Dresser receipts use the matching `.millstrand/conventions.edn` or `.ms/conventions.edn`.

## Activation

After approval, sync the operator runtime and activate `ct.spools.<name>`.

## Development

Local tests require an immutable Millstrand checkout at sibling `../millstrand` because the test alias uses `../millstrand/spools/workflow/src`; CI creates that layout.
